<title>UK: BayerVB sets 150 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</title>
<headline>BayerVB sets 150 million Swiss franc 10-year bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-12-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>- The following public bond was announced by joint lead managers Bank Von Ernst and Rued Blass &amp; Cie.</p>
<p> BORROWER   BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK OVERSEAS</p>
<p> GUARANTOR  BAYERISCHE VEREINSBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    150 MLN SFR   COUPON     4.00	MATURITY    17.JAN.07</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.75    PAY DATE    17.JAN.97</p>
<p> MOODY	AA1	 LISTING    EBS	 DENOMS (K)  FIVE</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
